{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1304111-contagion-fan-your-outbreaks","id":1304111,"title":"[Contagion fan] Your Outbreaks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-10T23:08:13-07:00","id":1304111,"title":"[Contagion fan] Your Outbreaks","content":"We have now few examples of various Contagions, now it times to prepare your own. Or modifying official ones. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> As I have my Viking Era Werewolf game, with pack of Norse coming to Constantinople after <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1137943-2e-fear-of-scales-%E2%80%93-dragon-idigam\">Dragon Idigam</a> that come from 'Greece' to their lands to discover how to kill it, I wanted them to uncover that it was Contagion that awoken and driven out Idigam from Byzantium.<br /> <br /> Now, it's year 800 in chronicle, so it's 'just' after last of outbreaks from Plague of Justinian / Black Death. ( First was in 541, last sickens en masses was seen in 750 year. ) Also, Idigam did not awoken with two hundred previous years of plague, so why did it need suddenly now?<br /> <br /> This are main solutions to using new Contagion in game:<br /> <br /> <b>1. Using canonical Plague of Justinian Contagion from Chapter 3 of Contagion Chronicle. </b><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1303812-contagion-plauges-of-history-origins-of-sworn\">From my reading</a>, it's about all death and (zombie) resurrection, over and over again, and weird spatial dimensional drifts. Not sounding as something to awoken Idigam - especially, as Plague is assumed too die out till year 800 then. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> 2. <b>Doing my own new Contagion, as new threat the Sworn in place are not ready to face. Maybe something that Spirits ( or other Ephemera ) are spreading?</b><br /> <br /> I was thinking about mixing it somehow with <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1137216-dark-eras-fan-byzantine-empire?p=1168431#post1168431\">Iconoclasm movement in Empire </a>- i.e. refusing the cult of icons and sacred statues - as it's very much touching Spirits and Essence generation - so logically it could awoken Idigam.<br /> <br /> 3. <b>Modifying official materials - like maybe using Gyro of Kyoto. </b><br /> <br /> I still did not read setting of Kyoto, but Gyro were announced as being related to Father Wolf, so it could work as awakening Idigam, probably. Yet, from spoilers till now, they do not seem much hard on Spirit side of problem.<br /> <br /> <b>What do you think? Do you have ideas for your own new strains of Contagion?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-11-2019, 04:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-11T01:26:56-07:00","id":1304126,"title":"","content":"My solution to the second point of my alternative...<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Byzantium \u2013 Contagion of Being</span></b></span><br /> <br /> It\u2019s started with cross. In 726 A.D. Emperor <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leo_III_the_Isaurian\" target=\"_blank\">Leo III the Isaurian</a> ordered to remove the painting of Christ from his Palace entering gate \u2013 and to place simple cross in it\u2019s place. It was start of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iconoclasm\" target=\"_blank\">Iconoclasm</a> movement in Byzantine Empire, wanting to abolish worship of icons and figures in Eastern Church. It was strongly opposed by the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iconodule\" target=\"_blank\">Iconludes</a>, people wanting to support worship of icons. Both factions fervently fought inside of Empire for the next almost hundred and twenty years.<br /> <br /> But it event also unleashed what mortals were not aware of. They could not be. The second Contagion ravaging the Empire made them unaware. Unneeded. Irrelevant. Erased from reality.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Symptoms</b></span><br /> <br /> It starts with your secondary traces of being. People start to miss you in conversation. You lose reflection, then your shadow. Then people omit you in life. And, finally, you simply cease to exist.<br /> <br /> Contagion started with Ephemeral Beings ( spirits, ghosts, goetia, angels, etc. ), worshiped as sacred items and anchored to those images. Spirits and ghosts started to lose Manifestations, then their Essence \u2013 and finally their Corpus, being erased from reality. And finally whole glory of Empire is forgotten and lost.<br /> <br /> Stages of Contagion are describing firstly effects on Ephemeral Beings, then after \u2018/\u2019 for the humans and physical monsters. Beasts of Dark Mother, Bound Sin-Eaters and Uratha werewolves are in worst situation because of this Plague \u2013 they response as they were <i>both</i> Ephemeral and physical beings, at once. On Stage 2 they lose Essence/Plasm/Satiety <i>and</i> their shadow. And on Stage 3 they lose Corpus ( Health in reality ) <i>and</i> lose contact with outside world.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Contagion Carrier (Persistent)</b><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Contagion-Touched</b> \u2013 Social penalty -1 to express oneself / Social penalty -1 as people subconsciously omit Touched in conversation.</li> <li><b>Infected (1)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Manifestation per day. When loss of last one \u2013 treated here as Twilight Form - next stage. / Loss of reflection in water, mirrors and similar.</li> <li><b>Infected (2)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 extra Essence per day. Cannot use Numina and Influences as ephemeral entity lacks the bodily cohesion to interact with other beings in Twilight. ( From lack of Twilight Form. ) A ghost who suffers this fate drifts through Twilight unable to be seen or touched even by other Twilight ghosts, alone and helpless to affect the world in any way, even only the world of ghosts. Spirit is locked in Twilight and cannot move to Shadow Realm on it\u2019s own. When loss of last one Essence point \u2013 next stage. If being has physical representation and at least 3 other material beings worship the representation \u2013 Essence lost is stopped for 24 hours. / Loss of shadow on any light source.</li> <li><b>Infected (3)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Corpus point per day. Uratha are checking entering Basu-Im each night because of Essence hunger. Begotten has 0 Satiety. When loss of last Corpus box \u2013 final stage. / People do not notice you unless you make physical contact ( transmitting Contagion then ).</li> <li><b>Disappearance</b> \u2013 Final outcome, you cease to exist.</li> </ol><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>Cure</b></span><br /> <br /> The Contagion based on being erased from reality is very difficult to fight. Even those afflicted by it are in impediment in communicating about symptoms with those trying to save them from non-existence. However large body on lore and history from over thousand years of this war with outbreak made it possible.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>The Sworn</b></span><br /> <br /> Sworn see Iconoclasm Contagion as possible end of their living \u2013 or at least history. They strife to not forget about their comrades and their own secrets.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>700-900s</b></span><br /> <br /> In first years of Contagion, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1137216-dark-eras-fan-byzantine-empire?p=1304030#post1304030\">newly founded Sworn in Byzantine Empire</a> did not even noticed it. It fell between the cracks, as the whole alliance was looking for the signs of next Plague of Justinian outbreak in that time. Unfortunately, disease has settled within Eastern Roman Empire. From then, it was mostly crisis management and hoping to cure the patients. However, each of Sworn groups tried, from time to time, some revolutionary way for stopping the disease. After few decades they observed that because the Contagion was sourced from Iconoclasm and destruction of the visage \u2013 the way to stop it was to created many visages of the patient and then to mark the worship of image on it. To say that those practiced seemed to look heretical, even to eyes of Iconludes, was to put it mildly. And then Sworn still looked for other ways stopping this outbreak.<br /> <br /> <b>Jeremiad</b><br /> Connected most with the Easter Church itself, the Penitents are in the center of Iconclams. Lancea Sanctum is doubling down on separation of worship in Empire, leading to their members distance themselves from the center of infections. Seeing how this Contagion is striving from destruction of icons, Sanctified in Jeremiad are hoarding holy images and statues, persevering them, so the new sources of disease would not spread more. They also most ardently worship them, to undo existing infections.<br /> <br /> Hunters in Darkness and Fire-Touched inside Church\u2019s holy places are defending icons before destruction with their own claws. They know that once Contagion will set in area, they are first to get the worst of it. It also lead to unusual alliance \u2013 Hosts also do not want to be in area of this Plague. As both physical and ephemeral like <i>Meninna </i>and <i>Izidakh</i> \u2013 they know they are most venerable to the gruesome effects of it. Hosts separated from their species simply decomposes and die.<br /> <br /> Begotten in Church are trying to preach \u2013 by word and Nightmares they send \u2013 that you must see and confront what you are afraid off. And by this, images helps us prepare to life we lead. Often, it ends with unofficial, private visages of mythological horrors that haunts particular painter or sculptor \u2013 but it sustain particular beast from Contagion if she became infected.<br /> <br /> <b>Athanatoi (Cryptocracy) </b><br /> Athanatoi, as predecessors of Cryptocracy we know now, try to fight with problem systematically. It\u2019s their secret support in in the elites of society that lead to support Iconludes in stopping the destruction of icons. Whenever they can, Immortals try to hijack commands that leads to more damages and possible spread of Contagion. It\u2019s Athanatoi influence on the Emperor\u2019s Court that maybe ended Iconclams madness.<br /> <br /> <b>Omphalos (Rosetta Society)</b><br /> The Omphalos understand Contagion as massage from God ( or gods ) that we do not understand. What could be massage that punish for destruction of icons? Of course, it\u2019s that we should hoard all knowledge and rebuild Great Library of Alexandria. It\u2019s maybe not universal answer in Sworn\u2019s members, but it surely have most support.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>What is to Come ( 700s-900s)</b></span><br /> Interesting conflict in Byzantium going over one century that hammered their Eastern Church doctrine, based on conflict between religious and \u2018extreme\u2019 secular forces in it. And it all started with <i>paintings</i>. Icons of holy figures, to be precise \u2013 like Christ, Mary, saints or angels.<ul><li>In 5<sup>th</sup> century A.D. Saint Augustin points that in Eastern Roman Empire popular was icon worship. In 6<sup>th</sup> century, it\u2019s gone over bowing to holy pictures and sculptures. In 7<sup>th</sup> century started to circle legends in Empire about <i>Acheiropoietos</i> \u2013 painting <b>not </b>created by human hand \u2013 and by this, created by God himself. There were stories about Icons bleeding blood, falling from the skies, curing sick and even resurrecting the dead!</li> <li>In 726 A.D. Emperor <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leo_III_the_Isaurian\" target=\"_blank\">Leo III the Isaurian</a> ordered to remove the painting of Christ from his Palace entering gate \u2013 and to place simple cross in it\u2019s place. It was start of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iconoclasm\" target=\"_blank\">Iconoclasm</a> movement in Byzantine Empire, wanting to abolish worship of icons and figures in Eastern Church. It was strongly opposed by the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iconodule\" target=\"_blank\">Iconludes</a>, people wanting to support worship of icons. Both factions fervently fought inside of Empire.</li> <li>One of greatest Iconludes of that time was <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_of_Damascus\" target=\"_blank\">John of Damascus</a> \u2013 he is said to so much enrage Emperor Leo III with his preaching and works that ruler command to sever one of his hands \u2013 and was locked for rest of his life in monastery of Saint Saba\u2019s in Palastine. After this, thousands of Byzantine sacral art was destroyed by Iconoclasts, across Empire.</li> <li>Pope Gregory III denounced Leo on Synod of Rome of year 731 A.D. Emperor chased Patriarch of Constantinople that reasoned with Pope. Gregory III then putted curse on Byzantine Emperor.</li> <li>Son of Leon III \u2013 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Constantine_V\" target=\"_blank\">Constantine V</a> \u2013 in year 754 he issued the edict that <i>any </i>representation of Christ is idolatry! He then gone step further and banned smoking candles and incense. It was not only based on rational thinking and fighting with Iconludes \u2013 but also about political show of power. In 8<sup>th</sup> century Eastern Church was still officially dependent on Rome and Pope, even with less and less sway over Byzantine priests. Constantine need to show he can control his own Empire before Pope. Emperor\u2019s soldiers were merciless to worshipers of icons \u2013 they blinded them or drowned them in bags. Monks that created icons were hunted and killed \u2013 at best. They are accounts of monks being mutilated, forced to break religious vows or marriage to whores. Monasteries were changed in to baths and barracks for Empires army. Iconoclasts burned icons. They destroyed mosaics on walls. They broke sculptures and iconostasis \u2013 special decorated walls for icons in Eastern churches. Monasteries were disbanded and valuables went to the treasury of Constantine. Iconludes were running before Empire oppression to Italy, Palestine and Cyprus.</li> <li>Council of Hieria was summoned by the Constantine V in 754 in the palace of Hieria opposite Constantinople. The council supported the emperor's iconoclast position in the Byzantine iconoclasm controversy, making it de facto state religion in Eastern Roman Empire. Opponents of the council described it as the <i>Mock Synod of Constantinople</i> or the <i>Headless Council</i> because no patriarchs or representatives of the five main patriarchs were present: Constantinople was vacant, Antioch, Jerusalem and Alexandria were controlled by Islamic rulers, while Rome was not asked to participate. Its rulings were anathematized at the Lateran Council of 769.</li> <li>After Constantine V death in 775 the Emperor become Leo IV that ruled only 5 years. In 780 Constantine\u2019s first wife, Irena, become Empress-regent over his son. She brought back religious freedom and worship of icons was once again safe in Empire. She even forced the arrangements Council of Hieria from being overturned almost entirely by the Second Council of Nicaea in 787, which supported the veneration of icons. Iconclasts in Empire were branded heretics by it!</li> <li>Empire was once again more or less stable, until the year 813 A.D. when Leo V become Emperor of Byzantium. He started to blame icons worshipers as reason for anything wrong in Empire. He removed Christ from his Palace gates and on once again called Council of Hieria in 815 he restituted rulings from year 754, in the same place.</li> <li>In year 821 Thomas the Slav lead the revolt against banning on icons worship and lessening the influence of land owners in Empire. Thomas was Byzantine commander, from Slavic descendants, that convinced Slavs, Arabs, Iberians and Persians, poor and excluded in Empire \u2013 all to join his vision of building better, more just world. He even was crowned Emperor by patriarch of Antioch and ruled in 821-823 A.D. big part of Asia Minor! He sieged Constantinople and impaled on a stake in 823. His supporters and their families were brutally repressed after it. Iconoclasts triumphed once again.</li> <li>In 843, Empress Theodora, after death of her husband <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theophilos_(emperor)\" target=\"_blank\">Theophilos</a>, ended Iconoclast by calling next synod on that she strengthen agreements of Second Council of Nicaea from 787. She made it after seeing monks Theodore and Teophanes from Jerusalem that had Iconclasts verses burned on their foreheads by Theophilos before. She said her husband he expressed remorse for his previous doings \u2013 and so she ended repressions of icons worship in Empire.</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-09-2020, 01:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-11T05:10:52-07:00","id":1304157,"title":"","content":"I have an idea of a Contagion as a basis for a hidden city of supernaturals all supporting and living together in a society, with all the citizens(including humans) being infected and the city leaders being Contagious. thats anyhow my brief idea that I'm planning on working with<br /> <br /> essentially a Contagion that breaks down boundaries, both physical and social.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":3742,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","user":"Iceblade44","date":". 04-11-2019, 09:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-11T05:39:26-07:00","id":1304165,"title":"","content":"My idea for an outbreak would be a contagion infecting an important piece if historical infrastructure, which causes a splinter reality, which is a kind of eternal echo of a historical dark era. As the contagion worsens, this DE echo reality starts to bleed thru into the regular reality and vis versa, creating that tilt. As this echo reality feeds on the regular reality it's spawns new echoes realities of other dark eras, which which also bleed into regular reality and each other. <br /> <br /> So maybe the first echo reality is the 7 wonders of the world era, which isn't a whole world, just the region covered by that DE. But as it's contagion worsens, it's spawns the Wild West DE echo reality, and that one Spawns the Sundered World DE echo reality, and so on. <br /> <br /> And maybe as an effect of beings infected by this contagion, the infected slide randomly between echo realities and regular reality when they sleep.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-11T10:25:50-07:00","id":1304237,"title":"","content":"Made first revision of my home made Contagion. Long way for me, but basis mechanics are in place, I think.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1304111-contagion-fan-your-outbreaks?p=1304126#post1304126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>Symptoms</b></span><br /> <br /> It starts with your secondary traces of being. People start to miss you in conversation. You lose reflection, then your shadow. Then people omit you in life. And, finally, you simply cease to exist.<br /> Contagion started with Ephemeral Beings ( spirits, ghosts, goetia, angels, etc. ), worshiped as sacred items and anchored to those images. Spirits and ghosts started to lose Manifestations, then their Essence \u2013 and finally their Corpus, being erased from reality. And finally whole glory of Empire is forgotten and lost.<br /> <br /> Stages of Contagion are describing firstly effects on Ephemeral Beings, then after \u2018/\u2019 for the humans and physical monsters.<br /> <br /> <b>Contagion Carrier (Persistent)</b><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Contagion-Touched </b>\u2013 Social penalty -1 to express oneself / Social penalty -1 as people subconsciously omit Touched in conversation.</li> <li><b>Infected (1)</b> \u2013 Blocking of 1 Manifestation per day. When loss of last one \u2013 next stage. / Loss of reflection in water, mirrors and similar.</li> <li><b>Infected (2)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Essence per day. When loss of last one \u2013 next stage. / Loss of shadow on any light source.</li> <li><b>Infected (3)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Corpus point per day. When loss of last one \u2013 final stage. / People do not notice you unless you make physical contact ( transmitting Contagion then ).</li> <li><b>Disappearance </b>\u2013 Final outcome, you cease to exist.</li> </ol></div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-11T15:11:08-07:00","id":1304325,"title":"","content":"In the CofD Dating Sim idea thread, I'm tempted to have it that one of the more common infected Infrastructure alterations has made it possible to build mecha suits used to fight especially large Contagious attackers on the city-states that survived the Wormwood Plague, to be as Japanese as possible. One of the climactic encounters, naturally, is with one of the Crucible Initiative's distinct Tancrede-class Crusader chassis. On foot.<br /> <br /> More seriously, I'm thinking of a Contagion of Haze inspired by Persona 4, one that causes a gradual dissolution of reality into something shaped by the id. In humans, it reshapes them into a form ideal for living in the foggy inconstant world, which is to say completely id-driven animals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-11T16:53:27-07:00","id":1304342,"title":"","content":"Fate, Reflection, Awareness, and Shadow are all ones I'm toying with.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Oh yeah, and Hope. Can't have the Sin of Hope without also making the Contagion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-11T20:56:33-07:00","id":1304389,"title":"","content":"Made new revision of rules around Iconclasm Contagion and added Cure respons of Sworn in 700s-900s. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1304111-contagion-fan-your-outbreaks?p=1304126#post1304126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Stages of Contagion are describing firstly effects on Ephemeral Beings, then after \u2018/\u2019 for the humans and physical monsters. Beasts of Dark Mother, Bound Sin-Eaters and Uratha werewolves are in worst situation because of this Plague \u2013 they response they were are <i>both</i> Ephemeral and physical beings, at once. On Stage 2 they lose Essence/Plasm/Satiety <i>and</i> their shadow. And on Stage 3 they lose Corpus ( Health in reality ) <i>and</i> lose contact with outside world.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Contagion Carrier (Persistent)</b><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Contagion-Touched </b>\u2013 Social penalty -1 to express oneself / Social penalty -1 as people subconsciously omit Touched in conversation.</li> <li><b>Infected (1)</b> \u2013 Blocking of 1 Manifestation per day. When loss of last one \u2013 next stage. / Loss of reflection in water, mirrors and similar.</li> <li><b>Infected (2)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Essence per day. When loss of last one \u2013 next stage. / Loss of shadow on any light source.</li> <li><b>Infected (3)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Corpus point per day. When loss of last one \u2013 final stage. / People do not notice you unless you make physical contact ( transmitting Contagion then ).</li> <li><b>Disappearance </b>\u2013 Final outcome, you cease to exist.</li> </ol><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>Cure</b></span><br /> <br /> The Contagion based on being erased from reality is very difficult to fight. Even those afflicted by it are in impediment in communicating about symptoms with those trying to save them from non-existance. However large body on lore and history from over thousand years of this war with outbreak made it possible.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>The Sworn</b></span><br /> <br /> Sworn see Iconoclasm Contagion as possible end of their living \u2013 or at least history. They strife to not forget about their comrades and their own secrets.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>700-900s</b></span><br /> <br /> In first years of Contagion, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1137216-dark-eras-fan-byzantine-empire?p=1304030#post1304030\">newly founded Sworn in Byzantine Empire</a> did not even noticed it. It fell between the cracks, as the whole alliance was looking for the signs of next Plague of Justinian outbreak in that time. Unfortunately, disease has settled within Eastern Roman Empire. From then, it was mostly crisis management and hoping to cure the patients. However, each of Sworn groups tried, from time to time, some revolutionary way for stopping the disease. After few decades they observed that because the Contagion was sourced from Iconoclasm and destruction of the visage \u2013 the way to stop it was to created many visages of the patient and then to mark the worship of image on it. To say that those practiced seemed to look heretical, even to eyes of Iconludes, was to put it mildly. And then Sworn still looked for other ways stopping this outbreak.<br /> <br /> <b>Jeremiad</b><br /> Connected most with the Easter Church itself, the Penitents are in the center of Iconclams. Lancea Sanctum is doubling down on separation of worship in Empire, leading to their members distance themselves from the center of infections. Seeing how this Contagion is striving from destruction of icons, Sanctified in Jeremiad are hoarding holy images and statues, persevering them, so the new sources of disease would not spread more. They also most ardently worship them, to undo existing infections.<br /> <br /> Hunters in Darkness and Fire-Touched inside Church\u2019s holy places are defending icons before destruction with their own claws. They know that once Contagion will set in area, they are first to get the worst of it. It also lead to unusual alliance \u2013 Hosts also do not want to be in area of this Plague. As both physical and ephemeral like <i>Meninna </i>and <i>Izidakh</i> \u2013 they know they are most venerable to the gruesome effects of it. Hosts separated from their species simply decomposes and die.<br /> <br /> Begotten in Church are trying to preach \u2013 by word and Nightmares they send \u2013 that you must see and confront what you are afraid off. And by this, images helps us prepare to life we lead. Often, it ends with unofficial, private visages of mythological horrors that haunts particular painter or sculptor \u2013 but it sustain particular beast from Contagion if she became infected.<br /> <br /> <b>Athanatoi (Cryptocracy) </b><br /> Athanatoi, as predecessors of Cryptocracy we know now, try to fight with problem systematically. It\u2019s their secret support in in the elites of society that lead to support Iconludes in stopping the destruction of icons. Whenever they can, Immortals try to hijack commands that leads to more damages and possible spread of Contagion. It\u2019s Athanatoi influence on the Emperor\u2019s Court that maybe ended Iconclams madness.<br /> <br /> <b>Omphalos (Rosetta Society)</b><br /> The Omphalos understand Contagion as massage from God ( or gods ) that we do not understand. What could be massage that punish for destruction of icons? Of course, it\u2019s that we should hoard all knowledge and rebuild Great Library of Alexandria. It\u2019s maybe not universal answer in Sworn\u2019s members, but it surely have most support.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-12T18:48:52-07:00","id":1304552,"title":"","content":"I have an idea for a Contagion of Progress, for a city that's perversely enamored of its glorious history and utterly incapable of dealing with its present problems (*coughcoughStLouiscough*). The Contagious start dreaming of the good old days, to the point they live parallel lives at night, and then just don't wake up....so some enterprising angel has started ripping holes in the timeline and bringing random stuff forward to compensate. The Ship of Theseus would be scandalized.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-13T03:05:42-07:00","id":1304596,"title":"","content":"I've gathered a lot of homebrew and 'fixes' over the years, not for use in most games (those kind of thing tend to shine best in a vacuum imo) but they work really well as infected.<br /> <br /> For example, the ST Vault recently got a new product called <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/271790/Kinslayers?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Kinslayers</a>. Generally speaking, I would not run this in a normal Beast game, unless it was an all Hero game. But as a infection, a place where those who are Devoured become these 'Heroes' and the true Heroes are slowly changing into this new breed as the Contagion spreads...<br /> Well, that works well.<br /> <br /> Basically any hack or variant can become a potential new form of the Infected, if not outright intruders like the Arisen in Edinburgh.<br /> <br /> Edit: I have also considered sporting over 1st edition variations of splats as another option.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":". 04-13-2019, 06:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-02T00:52:06-07:00","id":1309390,"title":"","content":"Drafting Iconclasm Outbreak with framework from <b>Contagion Chronicles</b> Storytelling Chapter. Now Ephemerals part\u2026<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Symptoms</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Outbreak Core:</b> It starts with your secondary traces of being. People start to miss you in conversation. You lose reflection, then your shadow. Then people omit you in life. And, finally, you simply cease to exist.<br /> <br /> Contagion started with Ephemeral Beings ( spirits, ghosts, goetia, angels, etc. ), worshiped as sacred items and anchored to those images. Spirits and ghosts started to lose Manifestations, then their Essence \u2013 then their Corpus, being erased from reality. As the Contagion spread, even non-infected individuals lose they reflections \u2013 like the mirrors and water resists to show anyone living in them. ( Non-infected undead like vampires and sin-eaters <i>are</i> still shown. ) And finally whole glory of Empire is forgotten and lost.<br /> <br /> Stages of Contagion are describing firstly effects on Ephemeral Beings, then after \u2018/\u2019 for the humans and physical monsters. Beasts of Dark Mother, Bound Sin-Eaters and Uratha werewolves are in worst situation because of this Plague \u2013 they response they were are <i>both</i> Ephemeral and physical beings, at once. On Stage 2 they lose Essence/Plasm/Satiety <i>and</i> their shadow. And on Stage 3 they lose Corpus ( Health in reality ) <i>and</i> lose contact with outside world.<br /> <br /> <b>Contagion Carrier (Persistent)</b><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Contagion-Touched</b> \u2013 Social penalty -1 to express oneself / Social penalty -1 as people subconsciously omit Touched in conversation.</li> <li><b>Infected (1)</b> \u2013 Blocking of 1 Manifestation per day. When loss of last one \u2013 next stage. / Loss of reflection in water, mirrors and similar.</li> <li><b>Infected (2)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 extra Essence per day. Cannot use Numina and Influences as ephemeral entity lacks the bodily cohesion to interact with other beings in Twilight. ( From lack of Twilight Form. ) A ghost who suffers this fate drifts through Twilight unable to be seen or touched even by other Twilight ghosts, alone and helpless to affect the world in any way, even only the world of ghosts. Spirit is locked in Twilight and cannot move to Shadow Realm on it\u2019s own. When loss of last one Essence point \u2013 next stage. If being has physical representation and at least 3 other material beings worship the representation \u2013 Essence lost is stopped for 24 hours. / Loss of shadow on any light source.</li> <li><b>Infected (3)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Corpus point per day. Uratha are checking entering Basu-Im each night because of Essence hunger. Begotten has 0 Satiety. When loss of Corpus box \u2013 final stage. / People do not notice you unless you make physical contact ( transmitting Contagion then ).</li> <li><b>Disappearance</b> \u2013 Final outcome, you cease to exist.</li> </ol><b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Consequences of Contagion</span></b><br /> <b>Ephemeral Beings:</b><ul><li><b>Loss of Manifestations </b>\u2013 Slow disappearance of Twilight Form, Reaching, Fetter and Posses or Claim makes ephemerals not possible to affect humans \u2013 so no healing, blessings and overwatching of spiritual entities of humanity. More deadly accidents, weaker tools, and first and foremost \u2013 no influence of ghosts and spirits on the mortals. People are becoming more and more agnostic in their worships.</li> <li><b>Loss of Essence ( and a like ) </b>\u2013 Weaker spirits ( and other ephemerals ) are easier prey for their enemies. Predatory spirits are more violent, weakened by Contagion spirits and ghosts looks for the way to jump over to the Flesh World and collect Essence directly. Spiritual landscapes madness. Hungry Werewolves without Essence and Beasts Satiety going down implies rampaging Uratha and Horrors in physical bodies on Flesh World. Mortals become more dull and detached from their emotions.</li> <li><b>Ephemerals cease to exist </b>\u2013 Like in Loss of Essence, but much more direct. Spirit World and Primordial Dream is turn upside-down with gaps in ecology. Underworld is much more \u2018hungry\u2019 as ghosts-slaves of it are disappearing. All the realms are starting to \u2018steal\u2019 mortals in place of their native ephemerals, to fill the roosters.</li> </ul>EDIT: I revision <b>Infected (3)</b> rules to accommodate Uratha and Beasts in <b>Contagion Carrier </b>section, given the 'worship image' damage control option.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-14-2020, 02:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-17T07:43:36-07:00","id":1341855,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1304111-contagion-fan-your-outbreaks?p=1309390#post1309390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Symptoms</b></span><br /> (...)<br /> Stages of Contagion are describing firstly effects on Ephemeral Beings, then after \u2018/\u2019 for the humans and physical monsters. Beasts of Dark Mother, Bound Sin-Eaters and Uratha werewolves are in worst situation because of this Plague \u2013 they response they were are <i>both</i> Ephemeral and physical beings, at once. On Stage 2 they lose Essence/Plasm/Satiety <i>and</i> their shadow. And on Stage 3 they lose Corpus ( Health in reality ) <i>and</i> lose contact with outside world.<br /> <br /> <b>Contagion Carrier (Persistent)</b><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Contagion-Touched</b> \u2013 Social penalty -1 to express oneself / Social penalty -1 as people subconsciously omit Touched in conversation.</li> <li><b>Infected (1)</b> \u2013 Blocking of 1 Manifestation per day. When loss of last one \u2013 next stage. / Loss of reflection in water, mirrors and similar.</li> <li><b>Infected (2)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Essence per day. When loss of last one \u2013 next stage. / Loss of shadow on any light source.</li> <li><b>Infected (3)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Corpus point per day. Uratha are checking entering Basu-Im each night because of Essence hunger. Begotten has 0 Satiety. When loss of Corpus box \u2013 final stage. / People do not notice you unless you make physical contact ( transmitting Contagion then ).</li> <li><b>Disappearance</b> \u2013 Final outcome, you cease to exist.</li> </ol><b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Consequences of Contagion</span></b><br /> <b>Ephemeral Beings:</b><ul><li><b>Loss of Manifestations </b>\u2013 Slow disappearance of Twilight Form, Reaching, Fetter and Posses or Claim makes ephemerals not possible to affect humans \u2013 so now healing, blessings and overwatching of spiritual entities of humanity. More deadly accidents, weaker tools, and first and foremost \u2013 no influence of ghosts and spirits on the mortals. People are becoming more and more agnostic in their worships.</li> <li><b>Loss of Essence ( and a like ) </b>\u2013 Weaker spirits ( and other ephemerals ) are easier prey for their enemies. Predatory spirits are more violent, weakened by Contagion spirits and ghosts looks for the way to jump over to the Flesh World and collect Essence directly. Spiritual landscapes madness. Hungry Werewolves without Essence and Beasts Satiety going down implies rampaging Uratha and Horrors in physical bodies on Flesh World. Mortals become more dull and detached from their emotions.</li> <li><b>Ephemerals cease to exist </b>\u2013 Like in Loss of Essence, but much more direct. Spirit World and Primordial Dream is turn upside-down with gaps in ecology. Underworld is much more \u2018hungry\u2019 as ghosts-slaves of it are disappearing. All the realms are starting to \u2018steal\u2019 mortals in place of their native ephemerals, to fill the roosters.</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, revisioning my Inconclasm Contagion idea. Reading more rules on Contagion, I see character simply goes from Infected (1) to Infected (2) and then Infected (3) simply by passing times of chapters without cure ( number of Stage +1 ). <b>However, how character goes from Contagion-Touched to Infected (1) Condition?</b> There is a way for stoping the Contagion ( avoid contact with source ), but there are <b>not</b> the rules for when character goes from Touched to Infected, finally.<br /> <br /> Other idea I have - <b>I thinking about adding extra rule for Infected (1) stage for werewolves</b> - where Ephemerals are losing Manifestations, Uratha would get extra Kuruth Triggers. But this seems to imbalance them against other hard hit supernaturals by Contagion - Beasts and Bound/Sin-Eaters - as those groups would <b>not</b> have something this hard on this stage. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Also, deciding extra Kuruth Triggers could be a problem on itself - Do infected Uratha get's new Kuruth Trigger set, with Passive, Common and Specific forms? Only one of them? If only one,<i>which</i> should character get? Maybe it's a too much a hurdle to get werewolves even worst than rest of afflicted monsters... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-09T01:22:19-07:00","id":1373703,"title":"","content":"Updated my Contagion of Being infection stages, with clarifying what happens to Ephemeral Entities when contacted with epidemic...<br /> <br /> <b>Contagion Carrier (Persistent)</b><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Contagion-Touched</b> \u2013 Social penalty -1 to express oneself / Social penalty -1 as people subconsciously omit Touched in conversation.</li> <li><b>Infected (1)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Manifestation per day. When loss of last one \u2013 treated here as Twilight Form - next stage. / Loss of reflection in water, mirrors and similar.</li> <li><b>Infected (2)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 extra Essence per day. Cannot use Numina and Influences as ephemeral entity lacks the bodily cohesion to interact with other beings in Twilight. ( From lack of Twilight Form. ) A ghost who suffers this fate drifts through Twilight unable to be seen or touched even by other Twilight ghosts, alone and helpless to affect the world in any way, even only the world of ghosts. Spirit is locked in Twilight and cannot move to Shadow Realm on it\u2019s own. When loss of last one Essence point \u2013 next stage. / Loss of shadow on any light source.</li> <li><b>Infected (3)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Corpus point per day. Uratha are checking entering Basu-Im each night because of Essence hunger. Begotten has 0 Satiety. When loss of last Corpus box \u2013 final stage. / People do not notice you unless you make physical contact ( transmitting Contagion then ).</li> <li><b>Disappearance</b> \u2013 Final outcome, you cease to exist.</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T13:19:50-07:00","id":1376145,"title":"","content":"While it may be in bad form, COVID-19 has given me some inspiration for a Strain Of The Contagion that uses the fear of a pandemic to reshape diseases into deadlier forms, while also subtly forcing a paradigm shift among humanity that discourages close contact with or compassion towards other humans out of a fear ( logical or irrational) of being infected by some sort of nebulous plague- to increasingly fearful and intolerant degrees- almost as if humanity invokes Disquiet in the presence of itself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-22T18:50:20-07:00","id":1376195,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1686_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1686\" data-vbnamecard=\"1686\">Korogra</a>, it seems a very similar idea to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1372113-fear-of-sickness\">Beasts as Fears of Sickness</a> - and a bit like <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1115824-dark-eras-2-1001-nightmares-islamic-golden-age-thread?p=1361889#post1361889\">Refrain from <i>1001 Nightmares</i> in <b>Dark Eras </b>2</a>. Maybe look on those for inspirations?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-22-2020, 10:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-23T02:37:43-07:00","id":1376228,"title":"","content":"The Beast one was completely unknown to me, and I must of skimmed over that part in Dark Eras 2. I\u2019ll have to look at that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-23T07:26:27-07:00","id":1376258,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1304111-contagion-fan-your-outbreaks?p=1376228#post1376228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Beast one was completely unknown to me,</div> </div> </div> </div>If you commit to read <b>Beast</b> - remember to read also <b>Beast Player's Guide</b>, if corebook is not griping. <b>BPG</b> is explaining a much better concepts than core, and expands giving new Families and Hungers, for example. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-23T10:08:56-07:00","id":1376272,"title":"","content":"I\u2019ve read the players guide, I like Horrorspawn. Beast itself just happens to be my least favorite game line for myriad reasons. I do read it from time to time whenever the masochistic urge to do so hits me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T22:53:17-07:00","id":1386922,"title":"","content":"After playing few sessions with my Vikings Werewolf players, I remade in my <b>Iconclasm Contagion</b> the <b>Infected (2)</b> stage to better reflect crisis management with making the sculptures or paintings of the afflicted to sustain they lives.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1304111-contagion-fan-your-outbreaks?p=1304126#post1304126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Contagion Carrier (Persistent)</b><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Contagion-Touched</b> \u2013 Social penalty -1 to express oneself / Social penalty -1 as people subconsciously omit Touched in conversation.</li> <li><b>Infected (1)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Manifestation per day. When loss of last one \u2013 treated here as Twilight Form - next stage. / Loss of reflection in water, mirrors and similar.</li> <li><b>Infected (2)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 extra Essence per day. Cannot use Numina and Influences as ephemeral entity lacks the bodily cohesion to interact with other beings in Twilight. ( From lack of Twilight Form. ) A ghost who suffers this fate drifts through Twilight unable to be seen or touched even by other Twilight ghosts, alone and helpless to affect the world in any way, even only the world of ghosts. Spirit is locked in Twilight and cannot move to Shadow Realm on it\u2019s own. When loss of last one Essence point \u2013 next stage. If being has physical representation and at least 3 other material beings worship the representation \u2013 Essence lost is stopped for 24 hours. / Loss of shadow on any light source.</li> <li><b>Infected (3)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Corpus point per day. Uratha are checking entering Basu-Im each night because of Essence hunger. Begotten has 0 Satiety. When loss of last Corpus box \u2013 final stage. / People do not notice you unless you make physical contact ( transmitting Contagion then ).</li> <li><b>Disappearance</b> \u2013 Final outcome, you cease to exist.</li> </ol></div> </div> </div> </div>I start to think what can be final cure - not the crisis management - that could solve this pandemics? Any ideas you have?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-30T02:49:31-07:00","id":1411060,"title":"","content":"So I return to the idea of Iconoclasm and <b>Werewolf</b>, returning to my game. Watching werewolf media, I think that my players need clear Prey to hunt the Contagion \u2013 werewolves stories are about hunting, in the end \u2013 and hunting the Iconclasm Contagion itself would be to nebulous as enemy. <b>I think about Prey that would reflecting the spread of the Iconclasm in Constantinopole \u2013 leading to at least stop of the large stop of spreading in city, or as the \u2018disease sample\u2019 to devise the Cure.</b> Maybe some sick and mutated Spirit Lord as Prey? What do you think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-30T13:54:32-07:00","id":1411115,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1304111-contagion-fan-your-outbreaks?p=1411060#post1411060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I return to the idea of Iconoclasm and <b>Werewolf</b>, returning to my game. Watching werewolf media, I think that my players need clear Prey to hunt the Contagion \u2013 werewolves stories are about hunting, in the end \u2013 and hunting the Iconclasm Contagion itself would be to nebulous as enemy. <b>I think about Prey that would reflecting the spread of the Iconclasm in Constantinopole \u2013 leading to at least stop of the large stop of spreading in city, or as the \u2018disease sample\u2019 to devise the Cure.</b> Maybe some sick and mutated Spirit Lord as Prey? What do you think?</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Don't crosspost. Let alone to three different threads.<br /> <br /> Take a warning.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-30T18:31:19-07:00","id":1411142,"title":"","content":"\u201cThe time would be easy to know, for then mankind would have become as the Great Old Ones; free and wild and beyond good and evil, with laws and morals thrown aside and all men shouting and killing and reveling in joy. Then the liberated Old Ones would teach them new ways to shout and kill and revel and enjoy themselves, and all the earth would flame with a holocaust of ecstasy and freedom.\u201d \u2014H.P. Lovecraft, The Call of Cthulhu <br /> <br /> I didn't back the Contagion Chronicles so I don't really know how the whole thing works yet, but I did recently break down and buy 'Berlin The Wicked City' to use as a possible Contagion setting and the quote above (which is included in the book) is my idea for a Contagion. An accelerating decent into destructive madness centered in Europe that includes everything from the Armenian Massacre to WWI and will ultimately culminate in the total conflagration of WWII (only worse) if the heroes don't head it off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}